React applications are generally built using components.

For example, imagine an e-commerce website :-
App
 |
 ├── Header
 |
 ├── ProductList
 │      |
 │      ├── Product
 │      ├── Product
 │      └── Product
 |
 └── Footer

Each part can be a separate React component.

