Why Components ?
Instead of writing everything in one huge file : App.jsx → 1000 lines

we divide it :-
Header.jsx
Product.jsx
Footer.jsx
App.jsx

This makes the application :-
Reusable
Maintainable
Easy to understand
Easy to test
